  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.upessc.up.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pardesh Secondary Education Services Selection Board (UPSESSB)</a> </span>has released the Interview Letter for selection to the posts of PGT (Post Graduate Teacher the Advt. No. 02/2022. The vacancy came in the year 2022 and it took almost two years to conduct the written examination for the prescribed posts. The Interview examination is going to be conducted on 15-27 June 2026. Candidates who qualified for this exam can download their UP PGT Interview Letter 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pardesh Secondary Education Services Selection Board (UPSESSB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP PGT Interview Letter 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSESSB UP PGT Advt No. : 02/2022</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>09 June 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>09 June 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>10 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>13 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Form Submit Last Date :<strong> 16 July 2022</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>09 – 10 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details : <strong>30 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>06 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>12 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result : <strong>02 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview Schedule : <strong>15-27 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Interview Letter : <strong>05 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC Candidates&nbsp;:<strong> Rs.750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">EWS Candidates : <strong>Rs. 650</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC Candidates :<strong>&nbsp;Rs.450/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC Candidates :<strong>&nbsp;Rs.250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">PH Candidates :<strong>&nbsp;Rs.375/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP PGT Notification 2022 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 July 2022</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : NA</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP PGT 2022 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 624 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2868%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5781%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Total Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2868%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher PGT (Balak)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">549</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5781%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>624</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.2868%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher PGT (Balika)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 28.135%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">75</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP PGT Bharti 2022 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.4049%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.5951%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.4049%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher (PGT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.5951%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Master Degree in Related Subject and B.Ed From Recognized University.&nbsp;will be eligible for these posts.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For Complete details –&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/up-pgt-eligibility-SarkariExam.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP PGT Online Form 2022 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Interview</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download UP PGT Interview Letter 2026 </strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download their UP PGT Interview Letter candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their UP PGT Interview Letter.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be are directed to the login page ,here they are required to provide their valid details-:</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Roll Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Need to select their batch</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Have to click on the “Submit” Icon</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their valid details candidates will be able to download their UP PGT Interview Letter.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download their UP PGT Interview Letter from official site of the UPSESSB.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"te